{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And I will bring you to the Amorite and the Hittite and the Perizzite and the Canaanite the Hivite and the Jebusite.</b> He did not mention the seventh, which is the Girgashite. This is what the Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: 'the Girgashite withdrew' — that is, they vacated the land of their own accord, and Israel did not need to wage war against them."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:03:20.815538027Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}